{"id":"ds:409:790:Dialogue Text","conversationId":409,"conversation":"act3/finleyQuest/02_meetCharlotteAndMelody","entryId":790,"actorId":"25","conversantId":"1","field":"Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=7]See Rascal, we were a bit of a handful as roommates…","sourceSha256":"a0930493a6d3aff623c7c9191a1e6f500c1bfac48e3603876a4fc769273e679e","target":"[pic=7]Видишь ли, Плут, жить с нами было непросто…","targetSha256":"395b014575dbfda20f619fcef8773fd89d72273c9f5dbf25200399b6e2d8f3cb"}
{"id":"ds:422:754:Dialogue Text","conversationId":422,"conversation":"act3/cookieQuest/03_CD_coyotes","entryId":754,"actorId":"14","conversantId":"1","field":"Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]But Finley used to be roommates with them. We’d all hang every so often.","sourceSha256":"109a7d159d0ced576165ee60ab2aec19741676f966192f7fcf09f2baf5907df2","target":"[pic=1]Но Финли раньше жил с ними. И мы все время от времени встречались.","targetSha256":"464b5dc283859096dc75672ac0d81dbce2ff6313a9479b0904f3d5548efe4a77"}
{"id":"ds:428:737:Dialogue Text","conversationId":428,"conversation":"act3/finleyQuest/04_finleyAndTheRoommates","entryId":737,"actorId":"25","conversantId":"1","field":"Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=7]Yes, we took you for granted and were just terrible roommates!","sourceSha256":"ccb08b38cfe40247dabc55bc9b37a2d47d00ec96f2cdd360334ab8af80a06aeb","target":"[pic=7]Да, мы тебя совсем не ценили и были ужасными соседками!","targetSha256":"4182cb045c7f3cc8289f3211cb73a0436215bbb30bf01b97aa4a911fb8663bbe"}
{"id":"ds:569:788:Dialogue Text","conversationId":569,"conversation":"gossip/bear/roomingFinley","entryId":788,"actorId":"1","conversantId":"4","field":"Dialogue Text","source":"How was rooming with Finley?","sourceSha256":"3bfdde4db2fe950a3753795bbd11bd8fbed873c1dd7c0eb292398a7b14d07f65","target":"Как тебе жилось с Финли?","targetSha256":"bc2a6be01b77182454ee74f15521773e49d69133acbce1a48512ffea3ebbfdeb"}
